  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOL Balkan Reconstr. Rep.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TOL Balkan Report</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Transitions Online skall publicera en Balkan Reconstruction Report som rapporterar om Balkans utveckling efter krigen. MAn arbetar med lokala journalister som samtidigt utbildas i modern journalistik. Projektet skall speciellt rapportera om Stabilitetspaktens arbete och dess projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transitions Online will publish a Balkan Reconstruction Report, reporting on development issues from the Balkans after the wars. They will work with local journalists, at the same time training them in modern journalism. The project will pay special attention to the work and success of the Stability Pact and its projects.</narrative>
  </description>
